  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping Help Guide\n\n### Bulk Approval of Receipts from DocScan\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 10 Sep, 2021 at 11:44 AM\n\n\t\tLocation: Bookkeeping Dashboard > DocScan\n\nRefer to the link\n\nClick here to watch how to perform bulk approval of receipts\n\nHelp/Guide:\n\nNavigate to the general Bookkeeping Dashboard and select DocScan from the menu on the left panel.\n\nOnce in DocScan, you will find a list of all scanned receipts from your clients there. \n\nYou will also find filters at the top to narrow down your search.\n\n Use the action drop down menu on the right hand side to Record or Reject those receipts.\n\nRecord will add the receipt to your clients' purchases.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000185558\">Bookkeeping Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Bulk Approval of Receipts from DocScan\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 10 Sep, 2021 at 11:44 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><strong>Location:</strong> Bookkeeping Dashboard &gt; DocScan</p><p><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/bookkeeping/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Refer to the link</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/9f1e4f9e0cfd45bba904b15b8d8f0f3b\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click here to watch how to perform bulk approval of receipts</a></p><p><strong><u><br></u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Help/Guide:</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p>Navigate to the general Bookkeeping Dashboard and select DocScan from the menu on the left panel.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9082711947/original/ZnWfs8SftC4_9dWg8NaShy-stZn56c2ylA.png?1564412673\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9082711947/original/ZnWfs8SftC4_9dWg8NaShy-stZn56c2ylA.png?1564412673\" data-fileid=\"9082711947\" data-uniquekey=\"1564412461898\" style=\"width: 718px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Once in DocScan, you will find a list of all scanned <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">receipts</span> from your clients there.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You will also find filters at the top to narrow down your search.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;Use the action drop down menu on the right hand side to Record or Reject those receipts.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Record will add the receipt to your clients' purchases.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9082712129/original/mJchF16Ok2dEVdNnRGubD2K24n691qyqhA.png?1564412777\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9082712129/original/mJchF16Ok2dEVdNnRGubD2K24n691qyqhA.png?1564412777\" data-fileid=\"9082712129\" data-uniquekey=\"1564412461898\" style=\"width: 809px;\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000173185\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000173185/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t